reagent-name-sunrise-antitussive = antitussin
reagent-desc-sunrise-antitussive = Clears up coughing, fever and other symptoms without touching the infection. The patient feels better and stays just as contagious.
reagent-physical-desc-sunrise-antitussive = thick and honeyed

reagent-name-sunrise-antimicrobial = suppressin
reagent-desc-sunrise-antimicrobial = Holds an infection back and makes it less contagious, buying time to find a vaccine. Hard on the liver in large doses.
reagent-physical-desc-sunrise-antimicrobial = cloudy turquoise

pill-label-sunrise-antitussive-20u = antitussin 20u
pill-label-sunrise-antimicrobial-20u = suppressin 20u

reagent-name-sunrise-disinfectant = disinfectant
reagent-desc-sunrise-disinfectant = A caustic mix for treating infection sites. Kills the contagion on items and bodies, but has no business in a bloodstream.
reagent-physical-desc-sunrise-disinfectant = sharply pungent
